Drawably for Jetpack Compose
============================

This library is a native Jetpack Compose port of Drawably, a hand-drawn UI
control library for the web.

    Drawably: https://www.drawably.dev
    https://github.com/Danilaa1/drawably
    Copyright (c) 2026 Daniel Belyi
    Licensed under the MIT License

The stroke-generation engine (dev.drawably.compose.core) is a direct port of
Drawably's `src/prng.ts` and `src/rough.ts`, and the layer geometry in
dev.drawably.compose.sketch follows `src/controls.ts`. Test fixtures under
drawably/src/test/resources are generated from the published npm package so this
port can be verified against upstream output.
